  "body": "I am a bit confused if HEIC/HEIF images are supported by ART. Given that they are pretty common nowadays, I assumed they are.\r\nI found this related, old issue: https://github.com/artpixls/ART/issues/178\r\n\r\nI just tried it, and added \"heic\" and \"heif\" to the list of \"parsed extensions\" in the settings, but they are still not displayed at all in the file browser. Is this a bug, or an unimplemented feature?\r\n\r\nI use ART 1.24.5.\r\n",
